@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@studentId = 1

### Tambah mahasiswa (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": "123450001",
  "nama": "Andi Pratama",
  "jurusan": "Informatika"
}

### Daftar (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Detail: sesuaikan studentId dari hasil POST (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}

### Ubah (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Andi Pratama Diperbarui"
}

### Filter (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?jurusan=Informatika

### Total mahasiswa (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/count

### Hapus (200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}

### Setelah dihapus: detail harus 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}

### Input salah (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": 123,
  "nama": "",
  "jurusan": "Informatika"
}
